Output out.svg
Set Width 900
Set Height 360
Set FontSize 20
Set Framerate 30
Set TypingSpeed 20ms
Set LineHeight 3
Set LetterSpacing 0
Set CursorBlink false
Set Theme debug
Set Margin 60
Set MarginFill "#6B50FF"
Set Padding 0

Env PS1 ">"
Set Shell env -i bash --noprofile --norc
Sleep 1000ms
Type `"`
Sleep 100ms
Enter
Sleep 100ms
Type ABC
Enter
Sleep 100ms
Type DEF
Sleep 1000ms
